# 14 October 2026: the V1 montage. A timeline spec (zrmd/timeline@1) of tracks and clips is validated, planned frame-exact and cooked into ONE
# HyperFrames composition per format (16:9, 9:16, 4:5, 1:1). Clips are motions of the workshop, local video or image files; text clips (titles,
# subtitles) are real text with a measured auto-fit; audio clips ride the same clock. A motion can be placed "text only": its background layers
# are hidden and it is rendered as an alpha WebM, so only its text and shapes overlay another video. Every tunable value lives in
# params/timeline.json (HDA law); every file is copied into the project (zero network, nothing leaves the Mac).
# FR : le montage V1 : pistes et clips valides, plan a l'image, une composition HyperFrames par format ; un motion peut etre pose « texte seul ».
